// The rule itself: intensional include, expandable only on a terminology server that
// holds the LOINC Ontology release named by the alias
* include codes from system $sct-loinc-ontology where constraint = "<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = 118584009 |Presence or identity (property) (qualifier value)|, 370132008 |Scale type (attribute)| = 117362005 |Nominal value (qualifier value)|, 704319004 |Inheres in (attribute)| = << 123038009 |Specimen (specimen)|"
